DISCLAIMER: NO WARRANTY

  Everything this project offers, on the website and in this repository, is offered as is, without
  warranty of any kind. The index, the links, the data-sheet values, the SPICE models and their
  characterisation may be incomplete, out of date or wrong: a part
  number read from a scan can be misread, a link can lead to the wrong document, a model can behave
  unlike the real part. Check anything that matters against the manufacturer's data sheet before you
  rely on it. Nothing here is professional or safety advice; mains and valve circuits carry voltages
  that can kill. To the extent the law allows, the authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
  arising from the use of this project or of the sites it links to.


